{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Jumpscare Simulator: Prologue is a short version that includes the first five chapters of the main game.</u></strong><br><br><br><strong>3 DIFFERENT GAME MODES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Linear Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features a <strong>linear experience</strong> with a mini story and hidden easter eggs. Find the correct sequence and <strong>don't forget it</strong>! Complete the levels that become more relaxing over time and achieve absolute victory against the simulation.  <u><i> </i></u><br> <br><u><i> </i></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1745421737\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test Your Luck:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no way to <strong>memorize</strong> the correct path here. Enter randomly generated rooms, take risks, progress, and try to achieve the highest score.  <br><u><i>Includes three different difficulty modes. </i></u><br> <br><u><i> </i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/extras/TESTLUCK.gif?t=1745421737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Waiting Room (2-Player Mode):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The waiting room mode is designed for <strong>local multiplayer</strong>. Enter the waiting room and enjoy the <strong>thrill of anticipation</strong>! In this completely unpredictable experience, you either win and pass your turn to the other player or face the <strong>scary woman</strong>\u2026 Designed for couples and friends to have fun together.  <br>Will something <strong>jump out</strong> on the screen? When will it happen? These uncertainties make this mode so <strong>entertaining</strong>! </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete the missing piece.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562660/11130b7f72e174d97e2bd3251bf024090884ecba.jpg"},{"name":"Boo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3562660/b70a09adb0aee20bbf051216a08d8dfac3fc7e00.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562660?t=1745421737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562660?t=1745421737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/f8be3eca0e5e34ea3c31336d0b5e1deb9c7db5b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745421737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/f8be3eca0e5e34ea3c31336d0b5e1deb9c7db5b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745421737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Jumpscare Simulator: Prologue is a short version that includes the first five chapters of the main game.</u></strong><br><br><br><strong>3 DIFFERENT GAME MODES</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Linear Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features a <strong>linear experience</strong> with a mini story and hidden easter eggs. Find the correct sequence and <strong>don't forget it</strong>! Complete the levels that become more relaxing over time and achieve absolute victory against the simulation.  <u><i> </i></u><br> <br><u><i> </i></u><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1745421737\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Test Your Luck:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no way to <strong>memorize</strong> the correct path here. Enter randomly generated rooms, take risks, progress, and try to achieve the highest score.  <br><u><i>Includes three different difficulty modes. </i></u><br> <br><u><i> </i></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/extras/TESTLUCK.gif?t=1745421737\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Waiting Room (2-Player Mode):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The waiting room mode is designed for <strong>local multiplayer</strong>. Enter the waiting room and enjoy the <strong>thrill of anticipation</strong>! In this completely unpredictable experience, you either win and pass your turn to the other player or face the <strong>scary woman</strong>\u2026 Designed for couples and friends to have fun together.  <br>Will something <strong>jump out</strong> on the screen? When will it happen? These uncertainties make this mode so <strong>entertaining</strong>! </p>","developers":["Durultay Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3551600","name":"Jumpscare Simulator: System Breach"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562660/18e3a237f3efc631c3bd2fff28705fcf61b5dcde/header.jpg?t=1745421737","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129865,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129865/movie480.mp4?t=1745421354","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129865/movie_max.mp4?t=1745421354"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129865/33acce12aa10658b5bd64a387b82e831f4c986f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745421354","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129865/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745421354","max":"http://video.akamai.ste